  "priorExpiration": "2017-06-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7106.01 Laboratory Accreditation, Independent Analysis. Any laboratory that performs an analysis of an additional test to determine its alcohol concentration pursuant to RSA 265-A:7, shall be accredited by a nationally recognized accrediting body pursuant to RSA 265-A:5, V.\n\nSource. #12064, INTERIM, eff 1-1-17, EXPIRES: 6-30-17; ss by #12216, eff 6-30-17",
